          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Yes. It is a museum in the centre, located on Trumpington Street. Can I help with anything else?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "No, you've been very helpful. Thank you."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "Enjoy your visit. Goodbye!"
        }
