          "text": "I booked El Shaddai successfully. Your reference number is AHYOTIAB. Is there anything else you need?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Learner",
          "text": "No, that's all. Thanks very much. Goodbye."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Assistant",
          "text": "You're welcome. Have a great day."
        }
